### Get all blogs
GET http://localhost:3003/api/blogs


### Add new blog
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tämähän toimii",
  "author": "Kirsikka",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "likes": 1
}

### Add new user
POST http://localhost:3003/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kirsikkBBB",
  "name": "KirsikkaBBB Vister",
  "password": "salainenBBB1234"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3003/api/users

### Login
POST http://localhost:3003/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kirsikkBBB",
  "password": "salainenBBB1234"
}

### Add blog with token
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_TÄHÄN

{
  "title": "AAAAA toimii!",
  "author": "KirsikkAAA",
  "url": "http://example.com",
  "likes": 1
}

### Delete blog (correct user)
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/**ID_TÄHÄN**
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_TÄHÄN

### Delete blog without token
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/**ID_TÄHÄN**